"<main role=\"main\" aria-label=\"Sun Yat-sen Memorial Hospital - First Western Hospital in China\" class=\"min-h-screen bg-white\"><section class=\"relative min-h-screen flex items-center justify-center overflow-hidden bg-slate-950\"><img src=\"https://conversation.cdn.meoo.host/conversations/305931829356183552/image/2026-06-08/1780904309467-中山大学附属第二医院.jpeg?auth_key=53b71345c10b5cd95e9e04c3c6448e32e45c993ebe98fa23f19e5c365d35f03c\" alt=\"中山大学孙逸仙纪念医院外观\" class=\"absolute inset-0 h-full w-full object-cover\"><div class=\"absolute inset-0 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-950/85 via-rose-950/70 to-red-950/80\"></div><div class=\"relative z-10 max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center text-white py-32\"><div style=\"opacity: 1; transform: none;\"><h1 class=\"text-4xl md:text-6xl font-bold mb-6\">中山大学孙逸仙纪念医院</h1><p class=\"text-xl md:text-2xl text-gray-300 mb-4\">中山大学附属第二医院</p><p class=\"text-lg text-gray-300 max-w-3xl mx-auto mb-8\">中国第一家西医医院 · 中国西医学和西医教育的发源地</p><div class=\"flex flex-wrap justify-center gap-4 mb-8\"><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">始建于1835年</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">7个国家重点学科</span><span class=\"px-4 py-2 bg-white/10 rounded-full text-sm\">四大器官移植资质</span></div><div class=\"flex flex-col sm:flex-row items-center justify-center gap-4\"><button class=\"px-8 py-3 bg-white text-red-900 rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\">了解更多</button><a class=\"px-8 py-3 border-2 border-white text-white rounded-full font-medium hover:bg-white/10 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">预约咨询</a></div></div></div></section><section id=\"intro\" class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">医院简介</h2></div><div class=\"grid grid-cols-2 md:grid-cols-3 lg:grid-cols-5 gap-6 mb-12\"><div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">1835年</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">建院时间</p></div><div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">7个</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">国家重点学科</p></div><div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">17个</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">国家临床重点专科</p></div><div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">四大器官</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">移植资质（心肝肾肺）</p></div><div class=\"bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6 text-center\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"text-3xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-2\">中国第一</div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm\">首家西医医院</p></div></div><div class=\"bg-gradient-to-br from-red-50 to-rose-50 rounded-2xl p-8 space-y-4\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">中山大学孙逸仙纪念医院（中山大学附属第二医院）创建于1835年，是中国第一家西医医院，也是中国西医学和西医教育的发源地。如今，它已发展成为一所集医疗、教学、科研于一体的大型三级甲等综合性医院，拥有7个国家重点学科和17个国家临床重点专科，综合实力雄厚。</p><p class=\"text-gray-700 leading-relaxed\">作为广东省高水平医院，医院还具备心、肝、肺、肾四大器官移植资质。医院的多个优势专科在全国都极具影响力，包括乳腺肿瘤中心、肿瘤科、心血管内科、泌尿外科、妇产科等。</p></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-slate-50\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">优势治疗项目</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">多个优势专科在全国都极具影响力</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 lg:grid-cols-3 gap-8\"><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-4\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600\">乳腺肿瘤中心</h3><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-xs font-medium rounded-full whitespace-nowrap ml-2\">国内首个公立乳腺肿瘤医院</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">以院士团队为引领</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>常规开展保乳手术及术后乳房重建等精准治疗</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>乳腺癌保乳率高达57%</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>保乳手术技术全国领先</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>在乳腺癌综合治疗方面具有显著优势</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-4\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600\">肿瘤科</h3><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-xs font-medium rounded-full whitespace-nowrap ml-2\">国家临床重点专科</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">常见恶性肿瘤个体化综合治疗</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>在乳腺癌、鼻咽癌、胃肠肿瘤的综合治疗方面优势显著</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>肺癌、肝癌等常见恶性肿瘤的个体化综合治疗</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>多学科协作诊疗模式</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>提供全方位肿瘤治疗方案</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-4\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600\">心血管内科</h3><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-xs font-medium rounded-full whitespace-nowrap ml-2\">国家临床重点专科</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">冠心病、心律失常及心力衰竭介入治疗</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>年冠脉造影手术超5000例</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>射频消融与起搏器植入技术成熟</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>在冠心病介入治疗方面经验丰富</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>心律失常诊治水平国内领先</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-4\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600\">泌尿外科</h3><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-xs font-medium rounded-full whitespace-nowrap ml-2\">国家临床重点专科</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">科室历史底蕴深厚，首创多项国内纪录</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>特别擅长使用达芬奇机器人进行微创手术</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>膀胱癌、前列腺癌等泌尿系肿瘤微创治疗</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>泌尿外科手术技术处于国际先进水平</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>微创手术比例高，患者恢复快</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-4\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600\">妇产科</h3><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-xs font-medium rounded-full whitespace-nowrap ml-2\">卓越表现和深厚积累</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">妇科肿瘤、生殖医学、复发性流产防治</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>宫颈癌、卵巢癌等妇科肿瘤诊治</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>试管婴儿成功率＞65%</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>复发性流产及早产防治</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>生殖内分泌疾病诊治</span></li></ul></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-6 shadow-sm hover:shadow-md transition-shadow\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><div class=\"flex items-start justify-between mb-4\"><h3 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600\">其他优势专科</h3><span class=\"px-3 py-1 bg-red-100 text-red-700 text-xs font-medium rounded-full whitespace-nowrap ml-2\">多学科协同发展</span></div><p class=\"text-gray-600 text-sm mb-4\">骨科、内分泌科、神经内科等</p><ul class=\"space-y-2\"><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>骨科：脊柱侧弯矫形、关节置换技术成熟</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>内分泌科：糖尿病、甲状腺疾病诊治</span></li><li class=\"flex items-start gap-2 text-sm text-gray-700\"><svg xmlns=\"http://www.w3.org/2000/svg\" width=\"16\" height=\"16\" viewBox=\"0 0 24 24\" fill=\"none\" stroke=\"currentColor\" stroke-width=\"2\" stroke-linecap=\"round\" stroke-linejoin=\"round\" class=\"lucide lucide-check-circle text-red-600 mt-0.5 flex-shrink-0\"><path d=\"M22 11.08V12a10 10 0 1 1-5.93-9.14\"></path><path d=\"m9 11 3 3L22 4\"></path></svg><span>神经内科：帕金森病、癫痫等疾病丰富临床经验</span></li></ul></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 lg:py-32 bg-white\"><div class=\"max-w-7xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8\"><div class=\"text-center mb-16\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-4\">专家团队</h2><p class=\"text-gray-600 max-w-3xl mx-auto\">汇聚院士、知名专家领衔的顶尖医疗团队</p></div><div class=\"space-y-12\"><h3 class=\"text-2xl font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-8 pb-4 border-b border-gray-200\">各科室核心专家</h3><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-6\">乳腺肿瘤中心</h4><div class=\"mb-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-red-700 mb-2\">宋尔卫</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">院士</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">宋尔卫</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">院士</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">乳腺肿瘤领域顶尖专家\n中国科学院院士\n引领乳腺肿瘤中心发展</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">刘强</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">乳腺肿瘤中心核心专家\n擅长乳腺癌综合治疗</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">苏逢锡</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">乳腺肿瘤中心核心专家\n在乳腺疾病诊治方面经验丰富</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-6\">肿瘤内科</h4><div class=\"mb-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-red-700 mb-2\">李鹤平</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">科室主任、主任医师</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">李鹤平</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">科室主任、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">肿瘤内科负责人\n擅长各类恶性肿瘤的综合治疗</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">李志花</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">科室副主任、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">肿瘤内科副主任\n在肿瘤个体化治疗方面有丰富经验</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">邱幸生</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">放疗专科、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">放疗专科专家\n擅长肿瘤放射治疗</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-6\">心血管内科</h4><div class=\"mb-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-red-700 mb-2\">王景峰</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">科室主任、主任医师</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">王景峰</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">科室主任、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">心血管内科负责人\n擅长心血管疾病诊治</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">刘品明</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">冠心病亚专科主任、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">冠心病亚专科负责人\n年冠脉造影手术超5000例\n射频消融与起搏器植入技术成熟</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">谢双伦</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">内科主任、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">内科主任\n在心血管疾病综合治疗方面经验丰富</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-6\">泌尿外科</h4><div class=\"mb-6 bg-red-50 rounded-xl p-6\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-red-700 mb-2\">黄健</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-600\">科室主任、主任医师</p></div><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">黄健</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">科室主任、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">泌尿外科负责人\n擅长泌尿系疾病诊治</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">何旺</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">常务副主任、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">泌尿外科常务副主任\n在泌尿外科手术方面经验丰富</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">董文</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">泌尿系肿瘤专科主任、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">泌尿系肿瘤专科主任\n特别擅长使用达芬奇机器人进行膀胱癌、前列腺癌等泌尿系肿瘤的微创手术</p></div></div></div><div class=\"bg-white rounded-2xl p-8 shadow-sm\" style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h4 class=\"text-xl font-bold text-red-600 mb-6\">妇产科 &amp; 生殖中心</h4><div class=\"grid md:grid-cols-2 gap-6\"><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">张建平</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">产科主任、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">产科主任\n尤其擅长复发性流产、早产防治\n在产科危急重症救治方面经验丰富</p></div><div class=\"border border-gray-200 rounded-xl p-6 hover:border-red-300 transition-colors\"><h5 class=\"font-bold text-[#1A1A2E] mb-1\">杨冬梓</h5><p class=\"text-sm text-red-600 mb-3\">生殖中心、主任医师</p><p class=\"text-sm text-gray-700 whitespace-pre-line\">生殖中心专家\n擅长生殖内分泌、多囊卵巢综合征及辅助生殖技术\n试管婴儿成功率＞65%</p></div></div></div></div></div></section><section class=\"py-20 bg-gradient-to-br from-red-600 to-rose-700 text-white\"><div class=\"max-w-4xl mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6 lg:px-8 text-center\"><div style=\"opacity: 0; transform: translateY(20px);\"><h2 class=\"text-3xl md:text-4xl font-bold mb-6\">百年名院 · 传承创新</h2><p class=\"text-xl text-red-100 mb-8\">地址：广州市沿江西路107号</p><a class=\"inline-block px-8 py-4 bg-white text-red-600 rounded-full font-bold text-lg hover:bg-gray-100 transition-colors\" href=\"/contact\">立即预约咨询</a></div></div></section></main>"